# Career360 Antigravity Ignore Rules
#
# Purpose:
# Keep agent context, indexing, search, planning, and verification focused on
# authoritative source code, configuration, documentation, and required assets.
#
# Never use this file to hide a security-sensitive file from source control.
# Git ignore rules and secret management remain separate concerns.

